WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.571
By the end, the app shows your contractors and your jobs, straight from your own Sheets.

2
00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:06.260
Five steps.

3
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.776
First, run your job list once by hand.

4
00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:13.580
Click Job collector, then Run now.

5
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.447
The first run takes about three minutes.

6
00:00:19.447 --> 00:00:22.140
When it says The run is finished, click OK.

7
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:31.400
Now we tell your contractor form Sheet where the jobs are, so the app gets both from one link.

8
00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:37.800
On your job list's Setup tab, under Links, copy the Job files folder link.

9
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.988
Switch to your contractor form Sheet.

10
00:00:43.988 --> 00:00:47.920
Click Contractor intake, then Set the jobs folder.

11
00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:51.644
A box opens.

12
00:00:51.644 --> 00:00:54.810
Paste the link you just copied, and click OK.

13
00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:00.845
When it says Jobs folder saved, click OK.

14
00:01:00.845 --> 00:01:02.700
Your two Sheets are linked.

15
00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.070
Now the one link the app needs.

16
00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:08.740
On this Sheet's Setup tab, under Links.

17
00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:12.672
Click the Download link, and copy it.

18
00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:14.920
The app calls it your do good link.

19
00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:16.980
Keep it private, like a password.

20
00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.019
Now open the app:

21
00:01:20.019 --> 00:01:21.460
double-click its icon.

22
00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.920
On the welcome card, click Paste your do good link.

23
00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:31.120
In the box, click Paste, then Test link.

24
00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:35.968
It says It works.

25
00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:37.400
No contractors yet:

26
00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:40.335
they arrive as people fill in your form.

27
00:01:40.335 --> 00:01:41.480
Click Save link.

28
00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:45.891
The app pulls in your contractors and jobs by itself.

29
00:01:45.891 --> 00:01:48.000
Next time, just click Get latest.

30
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.222
And there they are:

31
00:01:50.222 --> 00:01:52.300
four jobs, from your own job list.

32
00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:58.200
In the app, click Add your key and paste the same Gemini key.

33
00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:00.082
That's it.

34
00:02:00.082 --> 00:02:04.240
Both Sheets are yours, and the app reads them with one link.
